    "contents": "Physical breakdown visible beneath makeup: Sclera with thick red blood vessels across white surface. Dark circles beneath concealer - lavender-grey-purple undertone visible through coverage. Upper eyelids at 40-50% closure. Micro-tremor in perioral muscles (0.5-1mm). Moisture pooling along lower lash line. Facial muscles at reduced engagement - jaw slack, mouth corners requiring visible effort to maintain position. Skin at jawline showing gravitational sag.",
