    "description": "Profound dissociation - nobody home behind the makeup",
    "contents": "Eyes focused far beyond camera while facial expression held. Gaze depth and expression engagement disconnected. Facial muscles holding expression position (smile formed, mouth positioned). Eyes directed forward at camera location but focal depth set 15-20 feet beyond. Pupils dilated 6-7mm. Wet reflective tear film coating corneas. Expression muscles engaged, eye focus disengaged. Mouth shape present, eye connection absent.",
